{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2023-03-16 13:32:00', 'title': 'CARNIVAL CRUISE LINE ACHIEVES ANOTHER INDUSTRY MILESTONE AS IT BECOMES FIRST CRUISE LINE TO SAIL 100 MILLION GUESTS', 'text': "MIAMI , MARCH 16, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CARNIVAL CRUISE LINE HAS 100 MILLION REASONS TO CELEBRATE AFTER ANNOUNCING TODAY IT ACHIEVED A MAJOR MILESTONE FOR THE INDUSTRY AS THE FIRST CRUISE LINE TO EMBARK 100 MILLION GUESTS SINCE ITS FIRST SAILING. CARNIVAL PRESIDENT CHRISTINE DUFFY VISITED CARNIVAL SUNRISE TODAY AS GUESTS BOARDED THE SHIP AT PORTMIAMI, WHERE THE CRUISE LINE WAS FOUNDED, TO THANK THEM FOR CHOOSING FUN SINCE 1972 AND MAKING CARNIVAL THE WORLD'S MOST POPULAR CRUISE LINE."}